/member/483-flyboy254","user":"Flyboy254","date":". 08-27-2017, 02:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T11:11:13-07:00","id":1134529,"title":"","content":"Please include housewife as a profession for the Hearth of Hestia and Spy for MI18.<br /> <br /> Spy's ranks should be:<br /> <br /> O: Jonny English<br /> OO: Harriet the Spy<br /> OOO: Gary Unwin<br /> OOOO: James Bond<br /> OOOOO: George Smiley<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1134511#post1134511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you think they need updating Kings, make a condition 1 writeup.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe I will <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Save</span></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 08-27-2017, 02:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T11:15:25-07:00","id":1134530,"title":"","content":"How about &quot;Homemaker&quot; and &quot;Operative&quot; instead?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T11:46:53-07:00","id":1134537,"title":"","content":"From what I can see:<br /> <br /> <br /> PenDragon made (I presume, wording is vague) an alternate Endowment for Malleus Maleficarum: Gospels, that was transferred over from the old forums. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/3599-malleus-maleficarum-alternative-endowment\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> GibberingEloquence made an alternate Endowment for the Loyalists of Thule: Applied Secrets. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/346677-new-endowments-for-thule-loyalists-applied-secrets\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> TheKingsRaven posted an Endowment: Luck. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/20144-endowment-luck\">Link. </a> There's also an additional power for Benediction (presumably): St. Joan's Glory. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/267561-suggest-to-me-strategy-themed-endowments\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> TiwazTyrsfist posted an Endowment: Faith <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/3554-endowment-idea\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> amechra created an additional power for the Rites of Denial: Chain <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/360493-where-have-i-seen-this-rite-of-denial-before\">Link.</a> As well as Ink: Firebrand. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/293505-new-ink-firebrand\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> Because both Ronin Enterprizes and Haans-Chowdhury Productions involve mech-suits of sorts, we can definitely add some rules about Mechs in the CofD General forums. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> We could also add some of the power suits written by amechra for VALKYRIE and Cheiron. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/345652-mecha-suit-endowments-can-they-work/page2\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> Zolace expanded the Goetic Gospels while LostLight made an &quot;ultimate&quot; Gospel. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/780521-expanded-endowment-goetic-gospels-knights-of-st-george\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> Speaking of, there's a few extra ultimate Endowment powers in the Big Guns thread. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/162391-the-conspiracies-big-guns-new-endowments\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> Sirka Alkis has made a Sun Mystery for Witch Finders and has stated that they have done a Moon Mystery though I do not know where that is. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/81678-the-planetary-mysteries-new-fan-made-gutter-magic\">Link.</a> They also have a Vitality Mystery. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/405409-new-witch-finders-mystery-vitality\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> Also, the Fireman Profession. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/680717-profession-firefighter\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> And the Freeform Tactics as written by amechra. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/362783-gmc-freeform-tactics\">Link.</a><br /> <br /> There's also the Slasher Talents but that has already been submitted in the Drive<br /> <br /> <br /> Insofar, we are really heavy on Endowments, which isn't necessarily a bad thing as we have quite a bit of alternative takes and bonuses. Of course, this is the list I made within the last hour and I have neither slept well or eaten anything since waking up. I will come back to see if there is any additional material soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1417,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","user":"Reaper Verse","date":". 10-14-2017, 03:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T11:49:20-07:00","id":1134538,"title":"","content":"I had an entire list of links and such that failed to post. I am upset. But alas. <br /> <br /> Added the folders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T11:51:45-07:00","id":1134539,"title":"","content":"It's probably just a personal hang-up but it always felt weird to me that people treat the word housewife like it should be avoided. It feels like it's implying that raising the next generation isn't a respectable vocation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T11:55:03-07:00","id":1134541,"title":"","content":"Presumably, it's to keep it gender-neutral. Housewife/househusband are terms that can work but it generally implies marriage, specific genders, and domestic chores, while Homemaker sounds more like an occupation, can be used freely as a term, and seems to focus more on professional work like interior remodeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T11:57:36-07:00","id":1134542,"title":"","content":"Exactly. I mean, Hearth can have men in it's ranks too right? Plus, even in the US, stay-at-home dads are slowly growing in number.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":483,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","user":"Flyboy254","date":". 08-27-2017, 03:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg",