boy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T13:02:05-07:00","id":1148659,"title":"","content":"They look <i>good</i>!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T12:06:41-07:00","id":1149757,"title":"","content":"Okay, just realized a thing we need to do that will trim the fat off the project, we need to take out anything that's been designed as a Dark Era organization. Save that for another fan PDF, we should focus in on contemporary organizations.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> Societe de Hades completed, someone review and report.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":483,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","user":"Flyboy254","date":". 10-14-2017, 03:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T21:26:45-07:00","id":1149848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149757#post1149757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, just realized a thing we need to do that will trim the fat off the project, we need to take out anything that's been designed as a Dark Era organization. Save that for another fan PDF, we should focus in on contemporary organizations.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Huh. Didn't realize that some of our organizations are more Dark Era-esque. Know that Reighnhell wanted to revamp The Shih to modernize them. That would definitely reduce our numbers to a much more manageable size.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Edit:</b> Societe de Hades completed, someone review and report. </div> </div> </div><br /> Let's see, if I remember correctly, Societe d'Hades was missing Hunters and Stereotypes.<br /> <br /> First Hunter is someone who really liked spelunking and gradually grew into a member. Solid base. The same goes for the Fourth. Second and Third both mention la Brigade d'Intervention de la Compagnie Sportive in two different contexts; one mention of the group should be enough considering that the body text doesn't mention them and that their title is a bit of a mouthful to drop twice in the same section. The Second Hunter I feel is more interesting of a concept than the Third. Perhaps add a Hunter that was a historian who was following the French Resistance as that is a part of their history. <br /> <br /> The Stereotypes KSI-21 and The Brothers Prizrakov are pretty good but seem out of place, as I believe that most Stereotypes don't reference themselves. You could definitely make a mention of the Loyalists of Thule in an antagonistic manner, as la Societe d'Hades evolved out of the French Resistance who fought against Nazi occupation. The Ascending Ones is interesting, though the &quot;But...drugs&quot; part seems a little...off in a way. Null Mysteriis, I feel that there's some sort of reference that I'm missing when it comes to them.<br /> <br /> Ultimately, TheKingsRaven should have the final say in it, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T21:41:14-07:00","id":1149853,"title":"","content":"It's that I noticed as I was trying to edit several of the organizations they talked about past events in the present tense, like Maagal HaBaal. That's when I started to realize that several of Lost Light's groups, as well as the possibility of several others, just might be Dark Era materials.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T00:06:29-07:00","id":1149864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reaper Verse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149848#post1149848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Stereotypes KSI-21 and The Brothers Prizrakov are pretty good but seem out of place,</div> </div> </div> </div>I know. But it was too tempting to miss<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reaper Verse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149848#post1149848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Ascending Ones is interesting, though the &quot;But...drugs&quot; part seems a little...off in a way. Null Mysteriis, I feel that there's some sort of reference that I'm missing when it comes to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>What would you suggest for these two?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 10-15-2017, 04:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T01:04:03-07:00","id":1149873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149864#post1149864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would you suggest for these two?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think I read the Necronaughts as a group that know their stuff about the Underworld and consider everyone else kinda clueless. They make the maps and they know the dangers. Everyone else who isn't a member of la Societe d'Hades is a chump who really shouldn't be messing with the dead but it's not on the Necronaughts to teach them how to handle the Underworld. Also, their prolonged exposure to the Underworld make it seem like the Necronaughts have seen quite a few things happen and are pretty inured to them. I feel that they would see the Ascending Ones as a strange group but probably turn a blind eye to them whereas Null Mysteriis is too curious for their own good.<br /> <br /> <b>Ascending Ones:</b> <i>&quot;You'd think that drug traffickers would have better things to do than run an operation several miles below the surface of the Earth. Guess the dead really DO like to party.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>Null Mysteriis: </b><i>&quot;Brought some down with me to tour the caverns and had to keep three of them from collecting specimens from the River of Scorpions. They're like overgrown children in lab coats.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> I'm not particularly good at these. Gonna stick to pretty pictures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T01:57:03-07:00","id":1149879,"title":"","content":"I feel that as explorers the idea that we know more than anyone else doesn't fit. The whole point of being an explorer is that you're going into the unknown.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T04:02:33-07:00","id":1149893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149879#post1149879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel that as explorers the idea that we know more than anyone else doesn't fit. The whole point of being an explorer is that you're going into the unknown.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, though I think it is meant more as: they are veteran explorers, and the other groups are tourists.<br /> <br /> There is still plenty more for the Society to find out. &quot;Don't poke the crocodile-ghost&quot; isn't one of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T07:50:11-07:00","id":1149922,"title":"","content":"While I usually design my groups so that they could all operate in a modern setting (like speaking about the modern incarnation of the Maagal, or presenting alternative endings for the Lost Inocentes), I must admit that some of them have bigger focus on the past in their writeup than others. In that case, groups which have a major focus around a Dark Era are-<br /> <br /> The Silent Imperative<br /> Los Inocentes<br /> Aga Nritya<br /> Maagal HaBaal VeHaAshera<br /> Heirs of the Crown<br /> <br /> As 3 of those organizations are in my main &quot;wishlist&quot;, I would replace them with the following groups from my secondary wishlist- <br /> <br /> Apollonian Priesthood<br /> Church of the Blood Moon<br /> Garden of Hesperides<br /> <br /> Their place in the secondary wishlist is taken by the following-<br /> <br /> Chasseurs de Tetes<br /> Tiansheng<br /> Tecuanimeh<br /> <br /> again, I care more about groups from the main list than the secondary list, but in the end is up for the editors to call the shots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T09:23:16-07:00","id":1149937,"title":"","content":"LostLight, could you post your main and secondary wishlists again? I tried to cull the list of organizations we have based on the first list that you posted and the introduction that Flyboy254 posted but I want to make sure that the organizations are right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T10:28:37-07:00","id":1149947,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a> But surely how much knowledge groups like the Ascending Ones (who've been in the Underworld for a long time) have would be one of the mysteries. Hence why I'm not too keen on the arrogance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T10:48:05-07:00","id":1149950,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well they are French,&quot; says the American.<br /> <br /> Hey Kings, are KSI 21 the KGB compared to Section 9's Red Army?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":483,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","user":"Flyboy254","date":". 10-15-2017, 02:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T12:47:41-07:00","id":1149984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149947#post1149947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a> But surely how much knowledge groups like the Ascending Ones (who've been in the Underworld for a long time) have would be one of the mysteries. Hence why I'm not too keen on the arrogance.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Hmm...then maybe something like a stronger sense of caution? Possibly them wondering how an Ascending One can travel through the Underworld like it's their own backyard when la Societe d'Hades have made it a life's goal to mark out the paths of the Underworld. <br /> <br /> <b>Ascending Ones: </b><i>&quot;We have spent countless resources to make sure that each excavation can be carried out with the utmost safety while these people casually stroll through the catacombs like a walk through a park. <s>While high.</s> Who are these people?&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1417-reaper-verse","name":"Reaper Verse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1417_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T12:59:26-07:00","id":1149988,"title":"","content":"Are the Ascending Ones that good with Underworld phenomena?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T13:31:47-07:00","id":1149996,"title":"","content":"According to Compacts and Conspiracies they can open any gate without needing it's key by using an Elixir and harvest underworld mushrooms to make street drugs from. There's nothing saying explicitly that they smuggle drugs through the upper reaches, but it makes sense.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149950#post1149950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey Kings, are KSI 21 the KGB compared to Section 9's Red Army?</div> </div> </div> </div>KSI are indeed KGB, or at least some kind of intelligence organisation. I wasn't a fan of Section 9, so any relationships between the two are up to you.<br /> <br /> Logically the Brotherhood Prizrakov would have used it's money to buy a ton of influence when communism fell and would probably have their fingers stuck into the KSI pie. But I don't want to make that cannon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 10-15-2017, 04:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T16:17:17-07:00","id":1150025,"title":"","content":"Would you oppose a sidebar pointing out that the KGB and Red Army (And by extension, the Russian FSB and Russian military) aren't exactly &quot;buddy-buddy&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T13:58:19-07:00","id":1150201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reaper Verse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1127469-fan-group-pdf?p=1149937#post1149937\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">LostLight, could you post your main and secondary wishlists again? I tried to cull the list of organizations we have based on the first list that you posted and the introduction that Flyboy254 posted but I want to make sure that the organizations are right.</div> </div> </div> </div>here is the updated wishlists-<br /> <br /> <u><b>Compacts</b></u><br /> <b>Sabaoth-</b> a mercenary company which use alchemy to transform themselves into angels and hunt down those hated by Heaven<br /> <b>Silver Syndicate</b>- an investments company with ties in the underworld which use spirit magic to influence the stock market<br /> <b>Maw of the River-</b> a secret order of assassin which devour relics and their curses to bring them back to the River of Life<br /> <b>Theater of Tragedies-</b> brothel of cross dressers which use false identities to make pacts with demons and cheat their way out (may also be considered a Cult)<br /> <b>Nimrod Movement-</b> political movement which rebel against God and take over His angels to bring him down<br /> <br /> <b><u>Conspiracies</u></b><br /> <b>Zmei Initiative-</b> psychic Russian mercenaries which can track their origin back to the cold war<br /> <b>Schrlach Spinnwebe-</b> network of blood doll traders which use a strange blood magic to enslave the vampires who drink from them<br /> <b>Nibiru-</b> an ancient conspiracy which maintains the bindings of terrible old gods and seal new ones<br /> <b>Museum Secretorum-</b> collectors of strange phenomena and creatures which lock witches in amber to gain their powers<br /> <b>Al Rih al Asuad-</b> descendants of a Mesopotamian wind demons which fight against the spawn of Lamashtu<br /> <b>R.A.M-</b> an Israeli secret service which works to secure dangerous relics and infiltrate the cults which gather them<br /> <b>Ebony Fangs-</b> hunters of the dead which force upon them the Old Laws of the Underworld, which also slowly kill their organization (may be put in the Compact or Cult section if you prefer)<br /> <b>Mori Kage-</b> a clan of ninjas which are bound by pledge with the yokai to bring them back their escaped yosei<br /> <b>Orchestra Fatalibus-</b> musicians which were united during the French Revolution to sing a new fate against the one of the Fae (may be treated as a Compact of you think it is better)<br /> <b>Benei Topheth-</b> children which survived the dread Rite of Moloch and now hunt those who abuse the life of others for personal gain<br /> <b>Yam VeNahar Factories-</b> an Israeli chemical company which harvest other worlds and the souls of legendary beasts for resources<br /> <b>Navio de Tolos-</b> dream pirates which sail the Primordial Dream in search for freedom and adventure<br /> <b>Raziel, Ltd- </b>Israeli weapons manufacturers that believe it is a holy duty to hunt down the threats to the nation<br /> <b>Aki Ten:</b> Japanese practitioners of <i>Onmyodo</i>, using spirits are their vassals<br /> <b>Church of the Blood Moon-</b> an heretic sect which use mystical songs to reveal and lure wolf shaped demons (Conspiracy/Cult)<br /> <br /> <b><u>Cults and Cabals</u></b><br /> <b>Pythian Oracles-</b> prophets and diviners which are willing to kill in order to create a better future (Cabal)<br /> <b>Tartarus Enterprise-</b> a cancer conspiracy which works with and defends monsters to create wonders of technology (Cult? I think they are the only Cancer Conspiracy out there, which it is kinda its own thing)<br /> <b>Ashen Collective</b>- alchemists which seek for a way to harvest the human soul and use both humans and prometheans as test subjects (Cabal)<br /> <b>Order of the Nameless-</b> cult which summons and binds terrible demons from the Void in an attempt to one day take over it (Cult)<br /> <b>Temple of Silence-</b> servants of a long lost goddess which seek to bring eternal sleep to the Nameless Empire (Cult, need to revise their Endowments)<br /> <b>Pomegranate Deme-</b> collectors of antiques, fetter and memorabilia which practice orphic rites to bind the dead to their service (Cult)<br /> <b>Apollonian Brotherhood</b>- a cult which worships Apollo the Sun God as an example of excellence (Cult)<br /> <b>Garden of Hesperides-</b> old cult of healers which enter the Hedge to collect the herbs they need for their medicines (Cult)<br /> <b>Cage of Shadows:</b> Followers of Lilith, believing that it is their duty to elevate their Mother to rule over Earth (Cult)<br /> <b>Cult of Moloch:</b> Cultists who believe that no power can be gained without appropriate sacrifice (Cult/Cabal)<br /> <br /> and groups which may be cool if they could show up, but could be cut out for wordcount reasons-<br /> <br /> <b>Nemontemi-</b> aztec lineage of starry eyed children which now hunts the gods they once worshiped (Conspiracy)<br /> <b>E.V.E Institution-</b> scientific research facility which tries to evolve humanity to the next level, with the unwanted consequences of making them murderous monsters (Cabal)<br /> <b>Avici Sutra-</b> a reincarnating order of asuras which fight demons in order to escape the cycle of suffering (Conspiracy)<br /> <b>Eye of Heaven-</b> self proclaimed kingmakers which infiltrate cults in order to manipulate mummies in Heaven's name (Conspiracy)<br /> <b>A.S.T.R.A.L-</b> religious order turned data company which seeks to control the information flow to regulate Awakenings and transplant living magic to their flesh (Conspiracy)<br /> <b>Chasseurs de Tetes-</b> cabal turned hunters who follow a powerful Idea founded in the Reign of Terror (Conspiracy/Cult)<br /> <b>Tiansheng-</b> chinese bloodline born of trickery who hunt the yaogui under the Way and Mandate (Conspiracy)<br /> <b>Tecuanimeh-</b> servants of the Smoking Mirror and make sacrifices to hungry relics to survive the Black Sun (Cabal)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 10-17-2017, 01:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[